io_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"调到二十四度可以吗？","meaning_my":"နှစ်ဆယ့်လေးဒီဂရီ ထားရင် ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"遥控器在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ရီမုတ် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"遥控器在桌上。","meaning_my":"ရီမုတ်က စားပွဲပေါ်မှာ။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"关一下空调。","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်းလေး ပိတ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"空调可以关了吗？","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်း ပိတ်လို့ရပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"空调不制冷。","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်းက အေးမလာဘူး။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先看看是不是制冷模式。","meaning_my":"အအေးပေးမုဒ် ဟုတ်မဟုတ် အရင်ကြည့်။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"空调不凉了。","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်း အေးမလာတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"风太大了，调小点吧。","meaning_my":"လေအရမ်းပြင်းတယ်၊ နည်းနည်းလျှော့ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"空调别对着我吹。","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်းလေ ဒီဘက် တည့်တည့် မတိုက်အောင် လှည့်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我把风口往上调。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လေထွက်ပေါက်ကို အပေါ်ဘက် လှည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.01-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.01-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"风口别对着我。","meaning_my":"လေထွက်ပေါက် ဒီဘက် တည့်တည့် မထားပါနဲ့။","audio_fi