dio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"什么时候来水？","meaning_my":"ရေ ဘယ်တော့ ပြန်လာမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"说是下午能恢复。","meaning_my":"မွန်းလွဲပိုင်း ပြန်လာမယ်လို့ ပြောတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"来电了。","meaning_my":"မီးပြန်လာပြီ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"来水了。","meaning_my":"ရေပြန်လာပြီ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"要停多久？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大概两小时后恢复。","meaning_my":"နှစ်နာရီလောက်နေရင် ပြန်လာမယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"今天能恢复吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ပြန်အဆင်ပြေမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"只有我们家没电吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအိမ်တစ်အိမ်တည်းပဲ မီးပျက်တာလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不是，隔壁也停了。","meaning_my":"မဟုတ်ဘူး၊ ဘေးအိမ်လည်း မီးပျက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"整层都没水吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထပ်လုံး ရေမလာတာလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"有通知吗？","meaning_my":"အကြောင်းကြားစာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"通知说几点来电？","meaning_my":"အကြောင်းကြားစာမှာ မီး ဘယ်နှနာရီ ပြန်လာမယ်လို့ ရေးထားလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"物业怎么说？","meaning_my":"အဆောက်အအုံ စီမံခန့်ခွဲရေးဘက်က ဘာပြောလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"物业说下午来水。","meaning_my":"မွန်းလွဲပိုင်း ရေပြန်လာမယ်လို့ စီမံခန့်ခွဲရေးဘက်က ပြောတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"物业什么时候派人来？","meaning_my":"စီမံခန့်ခွဲရေးဘက်က ပြင်မယ့်သူကို ဘယ်တော့ လွှတ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"已经有人在修了。","meaning_my":"ပြင်နေတဲ့သူ ရှိနေပြီ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"已经通知物业了。","meaning_my":"စီမံခန့်ခွဲရေးဘက်ကို အကြောင်းကြားပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"好像又停电了。","meaning_my":"မီး ထပ်ပျက်သွားပြန်ပြီ ထင်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"停电的时候电梯还能用吗？","meaning_my":"မီးပျက်နေချိန် ဓာတ်လှေကား သုံးလို့ရဦးမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别坐，等来电再说。","meaning_my":"အခု မစီးနဲ့ဦး၊ မီးပြန်လာမှ စီး။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"水压怎么这么小？","meaning_my":"ရေအား ဘာလို့ ဒီလောက်နည်းနေတာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"家里停水了，能去哪儿接水？","meaning_my":"အိမ်မှာ ရေမလာလို့ ဘယ်မှာ ရေသွားခပ်လို့ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"停水之前能通知一声吗？","meaning_my":"ရေမဖြတ်ခင် ကြိုအကြောင်းကြားပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"哪里可以看通知？","meaning_my":"အကြောင်းကြားစာကို ဘယ်