dio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S010_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这儿漏水了。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ရေယိုနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S010_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"先把水关掉。","meaning_my":"ရေကို အရင်ပိတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"这个先别插电。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ပလပ်မထိုးနဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"先断电。","meaning_my":"အရင် မီးအားဖြတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"先别用了，找师傅检查。","meaning_my":"ဆက်မသုံးနဲ့ဦး၊ ပြင်သမားကို ခေါ်ပြီး စစ်ခိုင်းရအောင်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"能找人来看一下吗？","meaning_my":"ပြင်သမားတစ်ယောက် လာကြည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我联系师傅。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ပြင်သမားကို ဆက်သွယ်လိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"要不要叫电工来看看？","meaning_my":"လျှပ်စစ်ပြင်သမားကို ခေါ်ကြည့်ခိုင်းရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我问问房东能不能找人修。","meaning_my":"အိမ်ရှင်ကို ပြင်သမားခေါ်ပေးနိုင်မလားလို့ မေးကြည့်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"今晚能上门修吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီည အိမ်လာပြင်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"今晚没空，明天上午可以。","meaning_my":"ဒီည မအားဘူး၊ မနက်ဖြန် မနက်ပိုင်းတော့ ရတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"我白天上班，周末能来修吗？","meaning_my":"နေ့ဘက် အလုပ်ဆင်းရလို့ ပိတ်ရက်မှာ လာပြင်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"维修大概要多少钱？","meaning_my":"ပြင်ရင် ဘယ်လောက်လောက် ကုန်မလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"得先看看是什么问题。","meaning_my":"ဘာပြဿနာလဲ အရင် ကြည့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S020_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"修一下要多少钱？","meaning_my":"ပြင်ရင် ဘယ်လောက်ကုန်မလဲ။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S020_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"上门费要另外收吗？","meaning_my":"အိမ်လာကြည့်ခ သီးသန့် ပေးရသေးလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要，维修费另算。","meaning_my":"ပေးရတယ်၊ ပြင်ခက သီးသန့်ပါ။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"这个还能修好吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ပြန်ပြင်လို့ရသေးလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"能修，但得换个零件。","meaning_my":"ပြင်လို့ရတယ်၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ အစိတ်အပိုင်းတစ်ခု လဲရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"还能修吗？","meaning_my":"ပြန်ပြင်လို့ ရဦးမလား။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"可能要换新的。","meaning_my":"အသစ်လဲရမယ် ထင်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"闻到烧焦味了。","meaning_my":"မီးကျွမ်းနံ့ ရနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.04.03-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别用了，找专业人员。","meaning_my":"ဆက်မသုံးနဲ့ဦး၊ ကျွမ်းကျင်တဲ့ ပြင်သမားကို ခေါ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.04.03-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
